      "text": "Lamanites led by evil nature to become ferocious, Enos 1:20 (Mosiah 10:12). people of Noah3 shall be driven, even as wild flock is driven by ferocious beasts, Mosiah 17:17. sons of Mosiah2 preach to hardened and ferocious people, Alma 17:14. dissenters become more wicked and ferocious than Lamanites, Alma 47:36. Nephites are no more called Nephites, becoming wicked and ferocious, Hel. 3:16.",
